   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4c0ba0a78423aa2f0f60",
   "sourceHash": "4c0ba0a78423aa2f0f605ed0e5aa950d0ef2af80b947ef285048db469f2c3f65",
   "text": "了解 Kairali Ayurvedic Group 及其家族背景、阿育吠陀实践与患者教育。",
